msgid ""
"If you want to rotate the depth array/image by multiples of 90 degrees pass "
"the following ``hmirror``/``vflip``/``transpose`` combinations to "
"`read_depth`, `draw_depth`, or `snapshot`:"
msgstr ""
"Si vous souhaitez faire pivoter le tableau/l'image de profondeur par "
"multiples de 90 degrés, passez les combinaisons "
"``hmirror``/``vflip``/``transpose`` suivantes à `read_depth`, `draw_depth` "
"ou `snapshot` :"

